Two small tas2562 extensions needed by the Samsung Galaxy A52 4G (a52q):
frame-sync polarity inversion and a device-tree-pinned RX slot width.

Based on v7.3-rc5. Not independently tested on hardware by the
submitter tooling; on-device verification pending.

Miroslav Mráz (3):
  ASoC: tas2562: support frame-sync polarity inversion
  dt-bindings: ASoC: tas2562: add ti,rx-slot-width
  ASoC: tas2562: pin the RX slot width from the device tree

